/**
 * @defgroup logger_adapters_api Logger adapter API
 * @ingroup logger_api
 * @brief Adapter-facing contracts for the `logger` port.
 *
 * @details
 * Exposes the types required to implement `logger` adapters.
 *
 * This group provides the status type and backend dispatch-table types shared
 * between the `logger` port implementation and concrete adapter modules.
 *
 * Adapter implementations operate on their own backend instances and expose
 * backend operations through a @ref logger_vtbl_t. They do not own or
 * manipulate the opaque @ref logger_t handle directly.
 */
